  "notes": "Two-storey cream/beige house (#e3d8bf) with orange terracotta hip roof (#c85e34) and a front upper balcony with timber rail/pergola. A lower single-storey right wing under its own terracotta hip roof holds a white garage door. Windows have security grilles (not expressible). Frontage is a two-tone fence of cream panels with mustard/ochre framing (#b58a3f), a white panel double vehicle gate on the left and a grey ornate arched iron gate on the right; parasol in the yard, stone-slab forecourt, green bin, several parked cars. Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
